    "updated_at": "2021-04-01T14:47:32Z",
    "body": "Can you give an example of a prompt system that does what you expect? All starship does is read from the `CMD_DURATION` variable and decide whether to display the time or not, meaning that any fish prompt that doesn't go through heroics to get the last command and filter based on it will likely also have the same issue.\r\n\r\nAs an example, I'm pretty sure both spaceship and spacefish have the same behavior as we do.",
